AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002082> "x simultaneous with y iff ω(x) = ω(y) and ω(α ) = ω(α), where α is a function that maps a process to a start point, and ω is a function that maps a process to an end point and '=' indicates the same instance in time.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002082> "simultaneous with"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002082> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002081>)
SymmetricObjectProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002082>)
TransitiveObjectProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002082>)

